{"id":27731,"slug":"three-colors-blue","title":"Three Colors: Blue","year":1993,"country":"France","duration":98,"spine":588,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27731-three-colors-blue","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/release_boxshots/5319-1e493802cb24b298e04fcc18c21bc0da/CzbkwNHIrSc85MQhFib6NWNn4ZEI9A_original.jpg","description":"Juliette Binoche gives a tour de force performance as Julie, a woman reeling from the tragic death of her husband and young daughter, in this first film from Krzysztof Kieślowski’s Three Colors trilogy. But Blue is more than just a blistering study of grief; it’s also a tale of liberation, as Julie attempts to free herself from the past while confronting truths about the life of her late husband, a composer. Shot in sapphire tones by Sławomir Idziak and set to an extraordinary operatic score by Zbigniew Preisner, Blue is an overwhelming sensory experience.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Krzysztof Kieślowski","slug":"krzysztof-kieslowski"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Juliette Binoche","role":"Julie","slug":"juliette-binoche"},{"actor":"Benoît Régent","role":"Olivier","slug":"benoit-regent"},{"actor":"Florence Pernel","role":"Sandrine","slug":"florence-pernel"},{"actor":"Charlotte Véry","role":"Lucille","slug":"charlotte-very"},{"actor":"Hélène Vincent","role":"Journalist","slug":"helene-vincent"},{"actor":"Philippe Volter","role":"Real estate agent","slug":"philippe-volter"},{"actor":"Claude Duneton","role":"Doctor","slug":"claude-duneton"},{"actor":"Hugues Quester","role":"Patrice, Julie’s husband","slug":"hugues-quester"},{"actor":"Emmanuelle Riva","role":"Julie’s mother","slug":"emmanuelle-riva"},{"actor":"Florence Vignon","role":"Copyist","slug":"florence-vignon"},{"actor":"Jacek Ostaszewski","role":"Street musician","slug":"jacek-ostaszewski"},{"actor":"Catherine Therouenne","role":"Neighbor","slug":"catherine-therouenne"},{"actor":"Yann Trégouët","role":"Antoine","slug":"yann-tregouet"},{"actor":"Isabel